  { q: 'What is the best Facebook ad strategy?', a: "The one built for your customer, not a template. Start with who is already looking for what you sell, which is what the Demand Intelligence list gives you. Then make the ad look like a post from a person, not an ad from a company. Then send the click to a page that says the same thing the ad did. That's the strategy. Everything else is settings." },
  { q: 'Will I have to change my website?', a: "Usually not. We build a landing page for the ad traffic, so your website stays how it is. If something on the site is costing you calls, like a form that doesn't work on a phone, we'll tell you." },
